{"seq":1,"slug":"tesla-coil-and-high-frequency","title":"特斯拉线圈与高频技术","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/major-works/wireless-and-high-frequency/tesla-coil-and-high-frequency","wordCount":1739,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"特斯拉线圈与高频技术\">特斯拉线圈与高频技术</h1><p>1891 年的一场公开讲座上，特斯拉手持发光的灯管走上讲台——灯管并未连接任何导线，却在他周围的高频电场中自行点亮。观众席一片惊叹。让这一幕成为可能的，是他当年发明并以其名字命名的装置：特斯拉线圈。它是一台空芯谐振变压器，能把寻常电压抬升到数十万乃至数百万伏的高频高压，至今仍是高频电学教学与表演中最具标志性的器件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>特斯拉线圈的工作核心是「谐振升压」：一级回路储存能量并以脉冲方式激励，二级回路通过电磁耦合在谐振频率上累积出极高电压。与铁芯变压器不同，特斯拉线圈采用空芯（或部分铁芯），以适应远高于工频的射频频段——典型工作频率在 50 kHz 到 1 MHz 之间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[高压电源] --&gt; B[一级电容充电]&#10;  B --&gt; C[火花隙击穿]&#10;  C --&gt; D[一级LC回路振荡]&#10;  D --&gt;|电磁耦合| E[二级谐振线圈]&#10;  E --&gt; F[顶端电极聚集高频高压]&#10;  F --&gt; G[空气电离放电]\">flowchart LR\n  A[高压电源] --&gt; B[一级电容充电]\n  B --&gt; C[火花隙击穿]\n  C --&gt; D[一级LC回路振荡]\n  D --&gt;|电磁耦合| E[二级谐振线圈]\n  E --&gt; F[顶端电极聚集高频高压]\n  F --&gt; G[空气电离放电]</pre><p>下表对比特斯拉线圈与普通铁芯变压器：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>铁芯变压器</th>\n<th>特斯拉线圈</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>磁芯</td>\n<td>铁芯</td>\n<td>空芯/部分芯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作频率</td>\n<td>工频（50/60 Hz）</td>\n<td>射频（50 kHz–1 MHz）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升压机制</td>\n<td>匝数比</td>\n<td>谐振 + 匝数比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出电压</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n<td>数十万至数百万伏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要用途</td>\n<td>电力变换</td>\n<td>高频研究、无线实验、演示</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"1891-从铁芯到空芯的演化\">1891：从铁芯到空芯的演化</h2><p>特斯拉线圈不是一蹴而就的。按技术史的梳理，特斯拉的探索沿着一条清晰的脉络：先用闭合铁芯变压器在低频下工作，再为降低损耗重排绕组，继而移除铁芯、改用部分铁芯，最终发展出经典的锥形空芯特斯拉变压器。1891 年 4 月 25 日，他为这一电路申请了专利；同年在纽约哥伦比亚学院的讲座上公开演示。这一年因此被公认为特斯拉线圈的诞生年。</p>\n<p>驱动这一演化的根本动机，是频率。要研究并利用高频现象，必须摆脱铁芯在高频下的巨大涡流与磁滞损耗——空芯结构正是为高频而生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"谐振升压的物理原理\">谐振升压的物理原理</h2><p>特斯拉线圈的精髓在于「谐振」。一级与二级回路都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 振荡回路，其固有谐振角频率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega_0 = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{LC}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2514em;vertical-align:-0.93em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1833em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当两级回路调到同一谐振频率、并通过松耦合传递能量时，二级回路的电压会在多个振荡周期内逐步累积，远超单纯匝数比所能给出的升压。回路品质因数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 越高，能量损耗越小，可达到的峰值电压越高：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>L</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\frac{\\omega_0 L}{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最终，顶端电极上聚集的电压高到足以电离周围空气，形成壮观的放电火花。需要厘清一个常见误解：特斯拉线圈输出的是高电压、低电流，与「致命电流」是两回事——这也是它能用于公众演示的原因之一，尽管绝不意味着可以随意触碰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1899-科罗拉多斯普林斯实验\">1899：科罗拉多斯普林斯实验</h2><p>1899 年，特斯拉在科罗拉多斯普林斯建起一座大型实验室，把特斯拉线圈推向极限。这台「放大发射机」以约 300 千瓦功率运行，据记载可产生接近 1,000 万伏的电压，制造出长达 41 米（135 英尺）的人造「闪电」，雷鸣声据称在数公里外可闻。</p>\n<p>科罗拉多斯普林斯的意义不止于壮观的火花。在 1891 到 1900 年间，特斯拉用线圈完成了人类最早的一批无线输电实验——通过线圈间的电感耦合，在短距离内传递射频功率。他在此期间记录的大量观测，成为他构想全球无线输电、并随后建造沃登克里夫塔的实验依据。需要注意的是，他对「大地谐振」「驻波」的部分解释，以今天的电磁学标准看并不完全成立，这一点将在沃登克里夫一篇中进一步讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键参数与设计权衡\">关键参数与设计权衡</h2><p>特斯拉线圈的设计是一组相互制约的权衡，理解它们有助于把「壮观的火花」还原为可计算的工程对象。下表列出几个核心参数及其影响：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>提高它的效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>谐振频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 决定</td>\n<td>决定输出频段与线圈尺寸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品质因数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>储能与损耗之比</td>\n<td>越高峰值电压越高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>耦合系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>两级线圈耦合松紧</td>\n<td>过紧会击穿，过松效率低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入功率</td>\n<td>一级注入功率</td>\n<td>决定放电规模上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实际设计中，耦合系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 通常被刻意调得较松（典型在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> 之间），以便二级电压有足够多的振荡周期来累积，同时避免一级击穿。这种「松耦合谐振」正是特斯拉线圈区别于普通变压器的标志性取舍——它牺牲了瞬时效率，换取了极高的峰值电压。正因如此，特斯拉线圈不适合做电力变换，却成为研究高频高压现象的理想平台。</p>\n<h2 id=\"技术遗产-从演示到实用\">技术遗产：从演示到实用</h2><p>特斯拉线圈的影响沿两条路径延续。其一是直接的技术血缘：早期无线电发射机、医用高频电疗设备、点火系统乃至现代某些粒子加速器的高压级，都可追溯到谐振升压的思想。其二是它作为「高频可视化」工具的持久生命力——直到今天，科技馆、物理课堂和工程演示中，特斯拉线圈仍是展示高压、谐振与无线点灯现象的首选装置。</p>\n<p>更深层地，特斯拉线圈确立了一种研究范式：把电学推向高频与高压的极端，去观察导线之外、空气之中发生的现象。正是这种范式把特斯拉引向了无线传输的宏大构想。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>特斯拉线圈是 1891 年发明的空芯谐振变压器，把电压升至数十万至数百万伏的射频高压。</li>\n<li>其核心是谐振升压：两级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 回路调到同一谐振频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega_0=1/\\sqrt{LC}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，二级电压逐周期累积。</li>\n<li>输出为高电压、低电流，这是它能用于公开演示的原因之一。</li>\n<li>1899 年科罗拉多斯普林斯实验以约 300 千瓦功率制造出 41 米长的人造闪电，并开展早期无线输电试验。</li>\n<li>它既是实用技术的源头，也是延续至今的高频教学与演示工具，并直接引出了特斯拉的无线传输构想。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"特斯拉线圈与高频技术","id":"特斯拉线圈与高频技术"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"1891：从铁芯到空芯的演化","id":"1891-从铁芯到空芯的演化"},{"level":2,"text":"谐振升压的物理原理","id":"谐振升压的物理原理"},{"level":2,"text":"1899：科罗拉多斯普林斯实验","id":"1899-科罗拉多斯普林斯实验"},{"level":2,"text":"关键参数与设计权衡","id":"关键参数与设计权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"技术遗产：从演示到实用","id":"技术遗产-从演示到实用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多相输电与尼亚加拉瀑布水电站","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/major-works/polyphase-ac-system/polyphase-power-and-niagara-falls"},"next":{"title":"无线传输构想与沃登克里夫塔","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/major-works/wireless-and-high-frequency/wireless-transmission-and-wardenclyffe"}}